LS ALONG WITH A FEW SHOWERS AND THUNDERSTORMS TO DEVELOP MAINLY ALONG COASTAL AREAS.',84,29,76,24,87,31,72,22,76,24,66,19,0,17,'ccumberbatc','2025-12-28 17:38:20','ccumberbatc','2025-12-29 05:59:23','2025-12-29 05:59:23'),(7146,'2025-12-29','18:01:00',3,'CONDITIONS WILL BECOME MORE MOIST AND UNSTABLE TONIGHT INTO TOMORROW, AS A COLD FRONT APPROACHES THE AREA...','SKIES WILL BE CLOUDY AT TIMES TONIGHT BECOMING CLOUDY TO OVERCAST TOMORROW. SOME SHOWERS AND A FEW THUNDERSTORMS ARE LIKELY TO OCCUR OVER THE COUNTRY, ESPECIALLY ALONG COASTAL AND OFFSHORE AREAS TONIGHT, THEN OVER MOST AREAS DURING TOMORROW.',0,'5-15','[1,3]','','','','','[3]','2-4','','','','(TUESDAY NIGHT & WEDNESDAY)- SKIES WILL BE MOSTLY CLOUDY TUESDAY NIGHT BECOMING VARIABLY CLOUDY ON WEDNESDAY. A FEW SHOWERS, THUNDERSTORMS AND PERIODS OF RAIN WILL LIKELY OCCUR MAINLY ALONG COASTAL AND OFFSHORE TUESDAY NIGHT. ACTIVITY WILL THEN MOVED WELL OFFSHORE AND DECREASE WEDSNESDAY MORNING AS A COLD FRONT CROSSES THE COUNTRY, SUPPORTING DRY, COOL AND WINDY CONDITIONS.',79,26,72,22,81,27,68,20,70,21,62,17,0,11,'tmatthews','2025-12-29 15:14:51','tmatthews','2025-12-30 06:24:23','2025-12-30 06:24:23'),(7145,'2025-12-29','12:00:00',2,'OUR AIRFLOW IS BECOMING MOIST AND SOMEWHAT UNSTABLE.','SUNNY SKIES TODAY WITH CLOUDY INTERVALS. TONIGHT SKIES WILL BE CLOUDY AT TIMES. SHOWER ACTIVITY  WILL BE ISOLATED AT FIRST, THEN EXPECT  A FEW SHOWERS AND ISOLATED THUNDERSTORMS TO DEVELOP MAINLY OVER INLAND AREAS. TONIGHT THRU TO TOMORROW  AFTERNOON EXPECT A FEW OUTBREAKS OF SHOWERS AND THUNDERSTORMS TO DEVELOP MAINLY ALONG COASTAL AREAS.',0,'5-15','[5,3]','','','','','[3]','2-4','','','','FOR TUESDAY AFTERNOON  AND TUESDAY NIGHT IS FOR MOSTLY CLOUDY SKIES ALONG WITH A FEW SHOWERS AND THUNDERSTORMS TO AFFECT MOST AREAS, BUT MORE SO ALONG COASTAL AREAS. ON WEDNESDAY EXPECT PERIODS OF RAIN TO DEVELOP ALONG SOME COASTL AREAS AND OFFSHORE AT FIRST THEN DECREASING.',84,29,74,23,87,31,68,20,76,24,62,17,0,17,'ccumberbatc','2025-12-29 12:0