E SHOWERS, ISOLATED THUNDERSTORMS AND PERIODS OF RAIN OVER MOST AREAS.',86,30,78,26,90,32,72,22,80,27,68,20,0,7,'mgentle','2020-05-30 11:59:00',0,'2020-05-30 11:59:00'),(3410,'2020-05-30','12:00:00',2,'A TROPICAL DISTURBANCE IS AFFECTING THE AREA, SUPPORTING VERY MOIST AND UNSTABLE CONDITIONS.','SKIES WILL BE MOSTLY CLOUDY. SOME SHOWERS, ISOLATED THUNDERSTORMS AND PERIODS OF RAIN, WHICH MAY BECOME HEAVY AT TIMES, WILL AFFECT MOST PLACES THIS AFTERNOON THROUGH TOMORROW MORNING.','10-20','[5]','[4]','','','','[5,6]','FLOOD WARNING:  -HEAVY RAINS OVER THE COUNTRY IS CAUSING FLOODING NEAR BELMOPAN AND NEAR ST. MATHEWS ON THE GEORGE PRICE HIGHWAY. FLOODING IS ALSO POSSIBLE NEAR RIVERS AND STREAMS IN THE SOUTH AND OTHER LOW-LYING AND FLOOD PRONE AREAS.\r\n\r\nSMALL CRAFT CAUTION:  -OPERATORS OF SMALL CRAFTS SHOULD EXERCISE CAUTION AS WINDS MAY BECOME OCCASIONALLY GUSTY AND SEAS WILL BE ROUGH, ESPECIALLY NEAR HEAVY SHOWERS AND THUNDERSTORMS.','CLOUDY SKIES WITH SOME SHOWERS, THUNDERSTORMS AND PERIODS OF RAIN, WHICH MAY BE HEAVY AT TIMES, WILL AFFECT MOST PLACES SUNDAY AFTERNOON THROUGH MONDAY MORNING.',86,30,78,26,90,32,72,22,80,27,68,20,0,20,'crosalez','2020-05-30 18:00:12',0,'2020-05-30 18:00:12'),(3411,'2020-05-30','18:00:00',3,'MOISTURE AND INCREASED INSTABILITY ASSOCIATED WITH A TROPICAL DEPRESSION OVER THE EASTERN PACIFIC IS AFFECTING THE COUNTRY...','CLOUDY SKIES WITH SOME SHOWERS, THUNDERSTORMS AND PERIODS OF RAIN OVER MOST AREAS, STARTING OVER THE SOUTH TONIGHT.','10-20','[5]','[4]','','','','[5,6]','-TROPICAL DEPRESSION OVER THE EASTERN PACIFIC IS EXPECTED TO DISSIPATE OVER GUATEMALA BEFORE REACHING BELIZE. \r\n-FLOOD WARNING:FLOODING DUE TO HEAVY RAINFALL OVER THE COUNTRY IS EXPECTED TO CONTINUE NEAR RIVERS AND STREAMS AND IN LOW-LYING AND FLOOD PRONE AREAS, AS MAJOR RIVERS LIKE THE RIO HONDO AND LOWER BELIZE RIVER APPROACH BANK STAGE AND OTHERS INCREASE SLOWLY. THERE IS THE POSSIBILITY FOR FLASH-FLOODING NEAR COMMUNITIES ON THE EASTERN SLOPES OF THE MAYA MOUNTAINS. \r\n -OPERATORS OF SMALL CRAFTS SHOULD EXERCISE CAUTION, ESPECIALLY NEAR HEAVY SHOWERS AND THUNDERSTORMS WHICH MAY CAUSE OCCASIONALLY GUSTY WINDS AND LOCALLY ROUGH SEAS.','FOR SUNDAY NIGHT AND MONDAY IS FOR CONTINUING CLOUDY SKIES WITH SOME SHOWERS, THUNDERSTORMS AND PERIODS OF RAIN, ESPECIALLY OVER CENTRAL AND NORTHERN AREAS OF THE COUNTRY.',82,28,77,25,84,29,72,22,76,24,68,20,0,9,'syoung','2020-05-31 06:00:45',0,'2020-05-31 06:00:45'),(3412,'2020-05-31','06:00:00',1,'NEWLY FORMED TROPICAL STORM AMANDA, LOCATED SOUTH-SOUTHEAST OF GUATEMALA CITY, CONTINUES TO SUPPORT VERY MOIST AND UNSTABLE WEATHER OVER THE COUNTRY.','CLOUDY SKIES WITH SOME SHOWERS, THUNDERSTORMS AND PERIODS OF RAIN, WHICH MAY BE HEAVY AT TIMES, WILL OCCUR OVER THE COUNTRY, BUT ESPECIALLY OVER NORTHERN AND CENTRAL AREAS.','10-20','[5,6]','[4]','','','','[5,6]','***FLOOD WARNING: -FLOODING, DUE TO HEAVY AND PERSISTENT RAINFALL OVER THE COUNTRY, IS EXPECTED TO CONTINUE NEAR RIVERS AND STREAMS, AND IN LOW-LYING AND FLOOD PRONE AREAS. THERE IS A VERY HIGH POSSIBILITY FOR FLASH FLOODING AND LANDSLIDES, ESPECIALLY NEAR COMMUNITIES ALONG THE EASTERN SLOPE OF THE MAYA MOUNTAINS. \r\n\r\n**RIVER UPDATE: -THE BELIZE RIVER, NEAR BANANA BANK, NEARS FLOOD STAGE, AND WHILE THE RIO HONDO AND LOWER BELIZE RIVER APPROACH BANK-FULL STAGE OTHER RIVERS ARE INCREASING SLOWLY.\r\n\r\n**SMALLL CRAFT CAUTION: -A SMALL CRAFT CAUTION REMAINS IN EFFECT FOR OCCASIONALLY GUSTY WINDS AND LOCALLY ROUGH SEAS, ESPECIALLY NEAR HEAVY SHOWERS AND THUNDERSTORMS.','SIMILAR CONDITIONS ARE EXPECTED TO CONTINUE INTO MONDAY AND MONDAY NIGHT.',82,28,77,25,84,29,72,22,76,24,68,20,0,20,'crosalez','2020-05-31 11:55:32',0,'2020-05-31 11:55:32'),(3413,'2020-05-31','12:00:00',2,'INCREASED MOISTURE AND UNSTABLE CONDITIONS ASSOCIATED WITH  TROPICAL DEPRESSION AMANDA INLAND OVER GUATEMALA CONTINUES TO AFFECT THE COUNTRY...','CLOUDY SKIES WITH SOME SHOWERS, THUNDERSTORMS AND PERIODS OF RAIN CONTINUING MAINLY OVER NORTHERN AND CENTRAL AREAS THIS A